      "t": "2026-11-26T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "Al Jazeera reports that French actor Gerard Depardieu is set to stand trial for an alleged rape in 2018.",
      "cites": [
        "news:aljazeera:afe8a6b43d0b"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-26T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "On 26 November 2026, the Court of Appeal of Paris partially rejected Depardieu's challenge to his trial referral, confirming he will stand trial over the alleged 7 August 2018 assault in the Charlotte Arnould case.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1388183896:420"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-26T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "Gérard Xavier Marcel Depardieu, born 27 December 1948, is a French actor.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1388183896:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-26T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "Depardieu was born on 27 December 1948 in Châteauroux.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q106508:P569",
        "wd:Q106508:P19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-26T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "His records list 14 awards, among them the Stanislavsky Award (2006) and the Lumière Award for Best Actor (2007).",
